WEBVTT

00:01:31.560 --> 00:01:32.860
Then allow me!

00:01:32.860 --> 00:01:34.420
Not a chance!

00:02:02.760 --> 00:02:04.300
I'll protect you!

00:02:04.530 --> 00:02:07.230
After having Byakko
stolen by Ozma's team...

00:02:07.230 --> 00:02:10.660
Takao, Rei, and the rest of
the guys haven't recovered.

00:02:10.660 --> 00:02:14.030
But another mysterious
Blader has come on the attack.

00:02:14.030 --> 00:02:17.890
This time, it's a Blader who commands
a terrifying spider Sacred Beast.

00:02:18.280 --> 00:02:21.890
But Takao was saved by
Zeo's thoughtful assist,

00:02:21.890 --> 00:02:24.440
and was able to
win the battle.

00:03:05.800 --> 00:03:07.720
Dranzer!

00:03:18.200 --> 00:03:19.050
It's Kai!

00:03:25.150 --> 00:03:26.060
Kai--!

00:03:31.830 --> 00:03:33.410
Kai! Are you okay?

00:03:53.960 --> 00:03:55.410
What was that?

00:04:00.660 --> 00:04:02.500
You were attacked by wind?

00:04:02.500 --> 00:04:04.280
Yeah, we were.

00:04:04.280 --> 00:04:08.200
It was just for a moment, but it
blew in with an incredible force!

00:04:08.430 --> 00:04:11.040
But wind alone did
all this damage?

00:04:11.040 --> 00:04:13.640
Was someone after you, Kai?

00:04:14.360 --> 00:04:16.910
Are you sure no
one was there?

00:04:16.910 --> 00:04:19.470
At the very least,
I didn't see anyone.

00:04:19.470 --> 00:04:21.920
Neither a Beyblade
nor a Blader.

00:04:21.920 --> 00:04:26.000
How strange. I just can't believe that
it could be a natural occurrence.

00:04:26.000 --> 00:04:29.050
That wind was detestable.
There must be something to it.

00:04:29.050 --> 00:04:31.130
What do you
mean something?

00:04:31.130 --> 00:04:32.920
I don't know.

00:04:34.810 --> 00:04:36.920
Shut up, grandpa!

00:04:41.170 --> 00:04:43.330
Whoa!

00:04:43.730 --> 00:04:47.100
Did you attack
us earlier, grandpa?

00:04:48.750 --> 00:04:50.480
Don't get the wrong idea.

00:04:50.480 --> 00:04:53.490
This was already cut.

00:04:54.850 --> 00:04:58.750
A wooden sword could
never make a cut this clean.

00:04:58.750 --> 00:05:00.820
It's definitely
no sickle-weasel.

00:05:01.310 --> 00:05:04.800
I just wanted to
lighten the mood.

00:05:05.920 --> 00:05:07.010
What?

00:05:07.010 --> 00:05:09.440
Don't trick us like that!

00:05:10.180 --> 00:05:12.830
Maybe it's Ozma's team?

00:05:12.960 --> 00:05:16.070
Aiming for Kai's Suzaku
after getting Byakko!

00:05:16.070 --> 00:05:21.460
But don't you think they'd challenge us
head on instead of being all sneaky?

00:05:21.460 --> 00:05:23.380
You're right.

00:05:24.390 --> 00:05:26.730
So who was it, then?

00:05:30.450 --> 00:05:33.140
Bring it on!

00:05:33.140 --> 00:05:34.350
Here we go!

00:05:35.340 --> 00:05:37.110
--There!
--Let's go!

00:05:41.600 --> 00:05:43.300
Too bad!

00:05:43.970 --> 00:05:47.880
Battling Zeo and his
friends at a time like this...

00:05:47.880 --> 00:05:51.760
I wonder if Takao's being generous
or if he's just not paying attention...

00:05:51.760 --> 00:05:53.560
What was that, Kyoujyu?

00:05:53.560 --> 00:05:55.650
It's nothing!

00:05:55.650 --> 00:05:57.750
Come on!
Is that all you got?

00:05:57.750 --> 00:05:59.250
I'm still here!

00:05:59.250 --> 00:06:00.830
Go, Zeronix!

00:06:03.290 --> 00:06:05.760
You've got guts, Zeo!
Bring it!

00:06:05.760 --> 00:06:07.760
Zeo's really into it.

00:06:07.760 --> 00:06:13.490
Yeah. He's the one who had the idea
to gang up on Takao in the first place.

00:06:16.630 --> 00:06:17.710
Darn!

00:06:17.710 --> 00:06:19.060
Let's do it!

00:06:19.560 --> 00:06:20.940
Dragoon!

00:06:24.970 --> 00:06:26.640
What is this?!

00:06:29.150 --> 00:06:30.460
Takao!

00:06:35.300 --> 00:06:36.290
Takao!

00:06:39.640 --> 00:06:41.150
Are you okay, Zeo?

00:06:41.570 --> 00:06:42.770
Yeah.

00:06:52.610 --> 00:06:54.630
Wait, is this the--?!

00:06:58.290 --> 00:06:59.220
Zeo!

00:07:00.900 --> 00:07:04.800
Takao! Is this the same
wind that attacked Kai?

00:07:07.150 --> 00:07:08.420
What's that?

00:07:09.160 --> 00:07:10.260
Stop!

00:07:10.260 --> 00:07:11.310
Takao!

00:07:14.370 --> 00:07:16.350
Crap! Where'd he go?!

00:07:16.350 --> 00:07:20.900
They went after Bladers again...
This has to be an enemy attack!

00:07:20.900 --> 00:07:22.770
This is awful.

00:07:23.490 --> 00:07:25.130
Zeronix...

00:07:30.160 --> 00:07:31.910
Well done, Jack.

00:07:33.460 --> 00:07:37.830
Kinomiya and his team are panicking
against their invisible enemy.

00:07:37.830 --> 00:07:42.660
It's time for our new Sacred
Beast to show its real power.

00:07:42.660 --> 00:07:44.830
No, it's still too
inexperienced.

00:07:45.380 --> 00:07:47.760
Our target this time is Kai Hiwatari.

00:07:47.760 --> 00:07:51.250
We're going to attack
him until he cracks.

00:07:51.250 --> 00:07:52.420
Yes.

00:07:52.660 --> 00:07:57.940
They've already beaten two of the Sacred
Beasts we've extracted from the tablet.

00:07:57.940 --> 00:07:59.900
Failure is not an option.

00:08:01.110 --> 00:08:03.710
Do you hear me, Jack?

00:08:04.450 --> 00:08:06.130
Of course.

00:08:11.240 --> 00:08:13.780
What? A Sacred Beast?

00:08:13.780 --> 00:08:17.040
Yes, after running an
analysis on the footage,

00:08:17.040 --> 00:08:22.410
The strong shockwaves are a
perfect match for a Sacred Beast's.

00:08:22.410 --> 00:08:24.190
So that wind was
a Sacred Beast?

00:08:24.190 --> 00:08:28.670
So both Takao and Kai were
attacked by a Sacred Beast?

00:08:28.670 --> 00:08:30.170
Yes.

00:08:33.170 --> 00:08:36.160
Takao, so the guy who
was running must be...

00:08:36.160 --> 00:08:38.270
Someone not with
Ozma's group.

00:08:38.270 --> 00:08:41.050
What should
we do, Kyoujyu?

00:08:41.750 --> 00:08:43.920
I'm sorry, but
I haven't a clue.

00:08:43.920 --> 00:08:44.830
What?

00:08:44.830 --> 00:08:50.700
Well, how do you fight someone when
you can't see them or their Beyblade?

00:08:51.490 --> 00:08:54.500
Don't say that!
There has to be a way!

00:08:54.500 --> 00:08:58.050
There isn't! They're after
your four Sacred Beasts.

00:08:58.050 --> 00:09:01.460
You might lose the Sacred
Beasts before we know it!

00:09:01.460 --> 00:09:05.340
Or worse, your Beyblades
will be torn to shreds!

00:09:05.340 --> 00:09:06.800
How terrifying!

00:09:06.800 --> 00:09:10.260
Lose the Sacred Beasts?
You're kidding!

00:09:10.260 --> 00:09:13.740
Dammit! I don't know who
you are but stop hiding!

00:09:13.740 --> 00:09:16.210
Come out and fight us fair!

00:09:16.380 --> 00:09:20.400
First they seal them, and now our Beys
torn to pieces... They're mocking us!

00:09:21.040 --> 00:09:25.260
By the way, I haven't seen
Max around. Where is he?

00:09:25.260 --> 00:09:29.310
He said he got dragged off by
some of the neighborhood kids.

00:09:29.310 --> 00:09:31.890
To teach them
how to Beyblade...

00:09:33.730 --> 00:09:35.090
What is it?

00:09:35.090 --> 00:09:39.020
Come to think of it, Kai was
attacked while he was alone.

00:09:39.020 --> 00:09:43.000
And then Takao! The enemy
is attacking us one by one!

00:09:43.000 --> 00:09:45.620
That's it! Then we
just can't sit here!

00:09:46.120 --> 00:09:47.310
Max!

00:09:54.880 --> 00:09:57.060
Go! Beat Draciel!

00:09:57.060 --> 00:09:58.990
Yeah! Keep it up!

00:10:08.350 --> 00:10:09.890
Max, stop!

00:10:11.090 --> 00:10:13.420
You're in danger!
Stop the battle!

00:10:14.270 --> 00:10:15.370
Draciel!

00:10:23.800 --> 00:10:24.980
There!

00:10:24.980 --> 00:10:25.640
It's him!

00:10:25.640 --> 00:10:27.910
You little creep!
Get back here!

00:10:29.710 --> 00:10:32.530
Darn! He gets around fast...

00:10:32.930 --> 00:10:34.920
Max, how is Draciel?

00:10:36.490 --> 00:10:38.560
Looks fine to me.

00:10:39.170 --> 00:10:40.470
What's going on?

00:10:40.470 --> 00:10:43.230
It's a Sacred Beast!
That wind was a Sacred Beast!

00:10:44.850 --> 00:10:46.680
Get away from the fence!

00:11:09.310 --> 00:11:11.140
A mysterious Blader?

00:11:11.140 --> 00:11:14.510
Yeah. Someone else is
getting in our way.

00:11:14.930 --> 00:11:17.620
That wind Sacred
Beast is a real pain.

00:11:17.620 --> 00:11:20.760
It's clear that they're
just toying with them,

00:11:20.760 --> 00:11:23.810
but can Kinomiya and
them hide from this?

00:11:25.410 --> 00:11:27.020
They won't, right?

00:11:27.020 --> 00:11:29.500
They're a bunch of
do-gooders, after all.

00:11:29.500 --> 00:11:31.090
So what, then?

00:11:31.090 --> 00:11:33.200
We gotta crush
this party crasher.

00:11:33.200 --> 00:11:35.720
We can't let him
get the drop on us!

00:11:35.720 --> 00:11:37.270
Calm down, Dunga.

00:11:37.760 --> 00:11:40.870
It's hilarious that a big guy like
you can be such a worrywart.

00:11:40.870 --> 00:11:42.710
Don't get so
worked up over it.

00:11:42.710 --> 00:11:43.690
What?!

00:11:43.690 --> 00:11:47.180
Either way, I think it's better to wait
and see what their next move is.

00:12:08.830 --> 00:12:10.120
Rei.

00:12:10.960 --> 00:12:12.210
Kai.

00:12:16.420 --> 00:12:17.780
Rei!

00:12:17.780 --> 00:12:22.180
We told you not to go out
alone! You'll get attacked!

00:12:22.180 --> 00:12:23.860
What's the meaning of this, Rei?

00:12:23.860 --> 00:12:27.440
We can't sacrifice any
more of the Sacred Beasts.

00:12:27.440 --> 00:12:29.300
I'll defeat this
enemy myself.

00:12:29.300 --> 00:12:32.480
No way! Driger
doesn't have a--

00:12:32.480 --> 00:12:33.760
That's exactly why!

00:12:35.440 --> 00:12:39.300
I don't have
anything to lose.

00:12:39.600 --> 00:12:40.640
Rei...

00:12:40.640 --> 00:12:44.050
You can't beat the wind
Sacred Beast by yourself.

00:12:44.050 --> 00:12:45.340
What?!

00:12:47.540 --> 00:12:49.930
Don't bother.

00:12:54.300 --> 00:12:55.420
Kai...

00:13:03.270 --> 00:13:05.060
Are you ready?

00:13:05.060 --> 00:13:08.030
Yes. This is the moment
I've been waiting for.

00:13:08.030 --> 00:13:10.080
It's almost sunset.

00:13:10.080 --> 00:13:13.610
The perfect time for the
Sickle-weasel to run wild.

00:13:13.610 --> 00:13:15.490
It's as you say.

00:13:15.490 --> 00:13:18.710
Now, we just need to see if
Kai Hiwatari will show up...

00:13:18.710 --> 00:13:21.180
I hope he takes the bait.

00:13:22.200 --> 00:13:25.310
He will. That's just the
kind of boy he is.

00:13:26.880 --> 00:13:28.570
Go on, Jack.

00:13:28.570 --> 00:13:32.070
The next time I see you,
it'll be with Suzaku in hand.

00:13:32.070 --> 00:13:33.890
Yes. I promise.

00:13:43.200 --> 00:13:45.480
I can't take this!

00:13:45.970 --> 00:13:49.220
I can't just sit here
without knowing anything!

00:13:49.220 --> 00:13:50.380
I'm going!

00:13:50.380 --> 00:13:51.850
--Takao!
--Where are you going?

00:13:52.530 --> 00:13:56.140
Obviously to go find
that mysterious Blader!

00:13:56.140 --> 00:13:57.790
And challenge him!

00:13:57.790 --> 00:14:02.570
Takao, how many times have we told you?
We can't see his Beyblade or Sacred Beast!

00:14:02.570 --> 00:14:04.860
You'll lose if you
aren't careful!

00:14:04.860 --> 00:14:06.340
What do you
plan on doing?

00:14:06.340 --> 00:14:08.110
I'll figure it out!

00:14:12.240 --> 00:14:14.680
What's the deal, grandpa?
Popping out like that!

00:14:15.760 --> 00:14:18.610
Stop making a racket
and calm down, Takao!

00:14:19.410 --> 00:14:24.410
If I understand, you can't see your opponent yet
he cuts into you the second you realize he's there?

00:14:24.750 --> 00:14:27.570
He must be a
master of the sword.

00:14:27.570 --> 00:14:30.060
It's a Sacred Beast, FYI...

00:14:30.060 --> 00:14:31.560
--Shut up and listen to me!
--Yes, sir!

00:14:31.560 --> 00:14:34.150
You must lose the
battle to win the war.

00:14:34.150 --> 00:14:39.300
You must prepare yourselves to get a
little bruised when fighting a master.

00:14:39.650 --> 00:14:42.160
Is that something you
have steeled yourself for?

00:14:42.160 --> 00:14:44.000
W-well...

00:14:46.600 --> 00:14:48.510
What is it, Max?

00:14:48.510 --> 00:14:52.190
I thought it was odd that he
wasn't moving with all the noise!

00:14:52.190 --> 00:14:53.150
Kai!

00:14:53.150 --> 00:14:56.200
I thought he was sound asleep!

00:14:56.200 --> 00:14:59.630
Did he go off on his own
even after what he said to me?

00:14:59.630 --> 00:15:02.330
That jerk got a head start!

00:15:02.890 --> 00:15:05.000
Wait, will you?!

00:15:27.220 --> 00:15:28.430
Get out here.

00:15:32.240 --> 00:15:36.610
I'll give you points for having the guts to
come out and lose to me, Kai Hiwatari.

00:15:36.860 --> 00:15:40.660
I'll never forgive guys like you
who fight with cheap tactics.

00:15:41.140 --> 00:15:42.620
What's your name?

00:15:42.930 --> 00:15:44.690
My name is Jack.

00:15:44.940 --> 00:15:45.920
Get ready.

00:15:46.820 --> 00:15:48.780
Kai, that's not fair!

00:15:48.780 --> 00:15:51.110
Stay back!
This one is mine to defeat.

00:15:51.110 --> 00:15:53.260
But how will you?

00:15:54.570 --> 00:15:57.120
How cute.
Just try and beat me!

00:15:57.120 --> 00:16:00.290
I'll hack all of your
Sacred Beasts into pieces!

00:16:00.290 --> 00:16:03.360
Starting with you!
Kai Hiwatari and Suzaku!

00:16:04.320 --> 00:16:05.910
Scissor Swing!

00:16:05.910 --> 00:16:07.510
Dranzer!

00:16:09.800 --> 00:16:11.180
Go!

00:16:22.140 --> 00:16:24.500
Is that the wind Sacred Beast?

00:16:24.500 --> 00:16:25.490
Just you wait!

00:16:25.490 --> 00:16:27.160
Hold up there, Dunga!

00:16:27.160 --> 00:16:28.070
Outta my way!

00:16:28.070 --> 00:16:30.630
Dunga, let's see what
he can do, first.

00:16:30.630 --> 00:16:33.220
What kind of plan
Kai Hiwatari has.

00:16:35.040 --> 00:16:36.310
Here it comes, Kai!

00:16:36.310 --> 00:16:38.020
Dodge it!
You gotta dodge!

00:16:45.150 --> 00:16:46.500
What was that?!

00:16:46.500 --> 00:16:50.300
A part of Dranzer's Attack
Ring has been damaged!

00:16:50.300 --> 00:16:51.570
What?!

00:16:51.570 --> 00:16:55.110
What's the matter, Kai Hiwatari?
Out of options?

00:16:55.730 --> 00:16:58.670
Then I'll just have to
rip you to shreds.

00:16:58.670 --> 00:17:01.360
Scissor Storm!

00:17:04.220 --> 00:17:07.770
Darn! He's just
toying with him!

00:17:07.770 --> 00:17:11.030
If he gets hit by that,
he'll be helpless!

00:17:11.030 --> 00:17:12.420
Kai, get out of there!

00:17:20.660 --> 00:17:21.770
Again?

00:17:21.770 --> 00:17:23.450
Why isn't he dodging?

00:17:23.450 --> 00:17:26.080
It's because he knows
he's after Suzaku!

00:17:26.080 --> 00:17:26.920
What?

00:17:26.920 --> 00:17:30.210
The enemy won't finish him
off until he summons Suzaku.

00:17:30.210 --> 00:17:34.100
Kai's sizing up his opponent
until the last minute!

00:17:34.100 --> 00:17:37.990
Even so, what if he tries
to keep this up and loses?

00:17:37.990 --> 00:17:41.120
Go, Scissor Swing!

00:17:45.250 --> 00:17:46.450
Kai!

00:17:46.450 --> 00:17:48.140
He's done for,
don'tcha think?

00:17:48.140 --> 00:17:51.280
Ozma, what'll we do if he--?

00:17:51.990 --> 00:17:56.200
But it's so weird. He hasn't made
direct contact with Scissor Swing,

00:17:56.200 --> 00:17:58.340
so why is he taking
all that damage?

00:17:58.340 --> 00:18:01.130
Right. It can't just be
because of the wind!

00:18:01.130 --> 00:18:03.380
Kyoujyu, do you
have something?!

00:18:03.380 --> 00:18:06.520
I've been looking into
that for a little bit...

00:18:07.730 --> 00:18:08.860
What is it?

00:18:08.860 --> 00:18:13.100
I've got it! The secret lies in
his Beyblade, Scissor Swing!

00:18:13.100 --> 00:18:14.290
His Beyblade?!

00:18:14.290 --> 00:18:18.090
It whips up a tornado-like wind with
its incredibly fast rotation speed,

00:18:18.090 --> 00:18:23.240
which creates a vacuum in a fixed
position around his Beyblade.

00:18:23.240 --> 00:18:25.650
A vacuum? What do you mean?

00:18:25.650 --> 00:18:29.220
Any object that comes in contact
with that vacuum is torn to pieces!

00:18:29.220 --> 00:18:30.440
Like a sickle-weasel!

00:18:30.440 --> 00:18:31.810
A sickle-weasel?

00:18:38.710 --> 00:18:41.740
I want you to suffer as you
writhe in pain, Kai Hiwatari...

00:18:41.740 --> 00:18:44.500
And summon Suzaku!

00:18:44.500 --> 00:18:45.360
Kai...

00:18:45.360 --> 00:18:49.920
Is Kai letting himself get cut so
he can bait out his Sacred Beast?

00:18:49.920 --> 00:18:51.100
No way...!

00:18:58.400 --> 00:18:59.810
Dranzer!!

00:19:06.230 --> 00:19:07.280
There it is!

00:19:07.280 --> 00:19:08.480
Suzaku...

00:19:08.480 --> 00:19:09.880
Yes! Now's the time!

00:19:09.880 --> 00:19:11.620
Go, Sickle-weasel!

00:19:15.650 --> 00:19:16.470
I see it!

00:19:16.470 --> 00:19:17.560
A Sacred Beast!

00:19:17.560 --> 00:19:20.490
This is what Kai has
been waiting for!

00:19:20.880 --> 00:19:22.910
Suzaku!!

00:19:24.810 --> 00:19:28.140
Rip him in two, Sickle-weasel!

00:19:40.210 --> 00:19:41.690
Dranzer!

00:19:48.040 --> 00:19:49.750
Finish him off,
Sickle-weasel!

00:19:49.750 --> 00:19:51.010
Not going to happen!

00:19:51.750 --> 00:19:54.330
Yes! An attack
from underneath!

00:19:56.130 --> 00:19:58.200
Volcano Emission!

00:20:21.520 --> 00:20:22.740
Yes!

00:20:22.740 --> 00:20:24.550
I knew Kai could do it!

00:20:24.770 --> 00:20:27.120
We were worried
for nothing...

00:20:27.120 --> 00:20:28.100
Let's go.

00:20:28.100 --> 00:20:28.990
--Yeah.

00:20:39.050 --> 00:20:41.220
Blast you, Kai Hiwatari!

00:20:41.970 --> 00:20:47.430
Doctor. Despite our defeat, it's safe to say
the Sickle-weasel Sacred Beast fought well.

00:20:48.410 --> 00:20:52.310
Our tablet still has many other
Sacred Beasts sleeping within it.

00:20:52.680 --> 00:20:57.150
We will extract one of a higher level,
and then next time, for sure...

00:20:58.880 --> 00:21:01.710
Next time isn't good
enough for our fight!

00:21:01.710 --> 00:21:03.480
Remember that.

00:21:06.960 --> 00:21:09.290
Are you okay, Kai?
What about your injuries?

00:21:09.290 --> 00:21:13.220
Kai, you put your body on the
line to get a sense of his strategy...

00:21:13.220 --> 00:21:14.910
Take care of this.

